'''Moonshade Kaworu''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during both [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Neon Genesis Evangelion]] [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event/2nd Gacha Drop|Collaboration Gachas]]. He was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]]. This unit is a variant of [[Izanami of Dusk (Legend Rare Cat)|Izanami of Dusk]] with various different attributes.

